---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "@/components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import Prose from "@/components/Prose.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About the Studio — Custom Software & MVP Studio Pune"
  description="NextReach Studio is a founder-led, full-stack software development studio based in Pune, India, building custom web applications and business automation tools for SMEs."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="container-page relative">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 -translate-y-12 w-[400px] h-[250px] bg-amber-400/5 rounded-full blur-[90px] pointer-events-none -z-10 animate-pulse-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <header class="header-page animate-fade-in-up">
      <p class="header-page-pretitle">About the Studio</p>
      <h1 class="header-page-title">Direct, founder-led software engineering</h1>
      <p class="header-page-subtitle">
        We build practical web applications, business dashboards, automation flows, and MVPs for growing startups and local SMEs.
      </p>
    </header>

    <Prose>
      <h2>Our Background</h2>
      <p>
        NextReach Studio was founded in Pune, India, by a BCA graduate and full-stack software engineer with a clear mission: to make high-quality, custom business software accessible without the administrative bloat, delays, and high overhead of traditional agencies.
      </p>
      <p>
        We operate as a founder-led, solo/small-team studio. This means when you contract us, you talk directly with the engineer who is writing your code, configuring your database, and deploying your servers. We support local Indian SMEs looking to digitize their workflows, alongside international business projects that need fast-moving full-stack execution.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Core Philosophy</h2>
      <p>We work differently than typical software agencies:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>One-Time Scoped Pricing:</strong> We don't believe in open-ended hourly contracts that incentivize slow work. We agree on a clear scope of work and complete it for a set, one-time price.</li>
        <li><strong>Zero Account Managers:</strong> There is no game of telephone. You receive updates directly from the founder, ensuring technical decisions are made instantly and accurately.</li>
        <li><strong>Practical Engineering over Hype:</strong> We focus on building solutions that deliver business value—secure databases, fast load times, mobile-responsive layouts, and clean code that is easy to support.</li>
        <li><strong>Complete Ownership:</strong> Once the project is complete, you own the source code, the database setups, and all cloud assets. No vendor lock-in.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Proof of Technical Depth</h2>
      <p>
        We believe developers should demonstrate their capabilities openly. As part of our commitment to the software development community, we build and maintain an active <strong>AI Developer Resources Hub</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our free tools—such as the AI Token Calculator, LLM Cost Calculator, and VRAM Estimator—along with our in-depth guides on Claude Code, MCP servers, and context management, are used by developers around the world. We bring this exact same level of technical precision and consistency to our client projects.
      </p>

      <h2>Based in Pune, India</h2>
      <p>
        Our primary base is Pune, Maharashtra, supporting local service businesses, logistics firms, and startups in the region. We also work with select clients internationally, delivering remote projects across various time zones.
      </p>

      <h2>Start a Project</h2>
      <p>
        Have an internal workflow that needs automating, or a custom portal you want built? Read about our <a href="/services">services</a>, view our <a href="/portfolio">portfolio</a>, or <a href="/contact">contact us</a> directly to discuss your requirements.
      </p>
    </Prose>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
